{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "A nationwide referendum on reinstating the death penalty for child sexual abuse",
        "additional_details": "We ask the Government to allow the British people to vote in a national referendum to reinstate the death penalty for child sexual abuse that leads to death or life-changing harm.",
        "background": "We want the British public to have a say on whether the most serious child sexual abuse offences should be punishable by death or be tax-funded with life imprisonment.",
